<%= title("Your email address has changed") %>
<%= spacer() %>
<%= row do %>
  Your Operately account email is now <strong><%= @new_email %></strong>.
  This change applies to all your companies. Your existing sessions remain signed in.
<% end %>
<%= spacer() %>
<%= row do %>
  If you didn’t make this change, contact your organization administrator for help.
<% end %>
